# Ad Service Status Alerts with each alert having the following format
# unique status code:severity:message text
# Severity values are:
# 0 - Success
# 1 - Informational
# 2 - Warning
# 3 - Error
# 4 - Fatal
200:0:Web service reports successful request.
400:3:Web service reports bad request.
401:3:Web service reports unauthorized request.
403:3:Web service reports forbidden request.
404:3:Web service reports not found.
500:4:Web service reports internal server error.
